<title>USA: Charter Communications ends acquisition.</title>
<headline>Charter Communications ends acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charter Communications International Inc said Thursday it terminated its planned acquisition of Interlink Telecommunications Inc.</p>
<p>Charter Communications' chief executive David Olson said talks were mutually terminated. The company did not provide any reason for ending talks.</p>
<p>Charter, which develops satellite telecommunication and electronic commerce services, said it has no future plans to resume the discussions.</p>
<p>Plans for the acquisition were announced August 27.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
